          "version_number increments once on same row after accepted save",
          "layout_status is not changed by this PATCH",
          "created_at",
          "created_by_user_id"
        ],
        "semantics": "PATCH allows only name, canvasWidth, canvasHeight, layoutData plus required expectedVersion; layoutData is full replacement; accepted save increments this row version by one.",
